<title>USA: National Computer in Hong Kong venture.</title>
<headline>National Computer in Hong Kong venture.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Computer Systems Inc said it has formed a joint venture with Worldneed Computer Consultants Ltd.</p>
<p>The new company, called NCS Hong Kong Ltd, is 51 percent owned by National Computer. Worldneed is National Computer's current distributor in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>In a release, National Computer said developing a direct presence in Hong Kong is a key part of its strategy for the region.</p>
<p>National Computer is an information services company providing software, services and systems.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
